# Every shell shot `test/shots/shots` takes, one per line:
#
#   NAME  SURFACE  DRIVER  CROP  [ARG...]
#
# NAME names the files (NAME-MODE-SCALEx.png). SURFACE is what `shots SURFACE` and the change
# detection in `surfaces` pick by. DRIVER is a file in drivers/, run with `-- MODE OUT ARG...`.
# CROP is the part of the 1600×1000 logical screen the pair shows, `X,Y,W,H` in logical pixels,
# or `-` for the whole window.
